info
# Issue #1934: the fleet supervisor's out-of-band dead-review-claim reap
# scheduler runs the shared sweep set once per selected repo on its own
# interval (default 300 s), independent of -- and concurrent with -- the
# per-repo lane pool, so a dead claim is freed on a ~5-minute cadence
# instead of once per fleet-wide round. Emitted once per repo per round
# into the fleet-level (daemon) events.db; a per-repo sweep failure emits
# the same kind with an explicit level="warning" override.
